  "summary": "Gemini is entering a period of transition focused on home and personal life. The horoscope encourages imagining the best timeline and moving toward it despite uncertainty. Readers are reminded they can manifest positive change by making peace with circumstances and taking steps to improve wellbeing. Prioritise health this week.",
  "content": "Transition is your theme this week, Gemini. Your home and personal life are undergoing massive, pivotal shifts and you are being nudged to follow the prompts of the cosmos in your desired direction. Your guides are encouraging you to imagine the best possible way forward, conjure the highest possible timeline for yourself and then simply make your way towards it.\n\nThis chapter may feel uncertain but this week reminds you that you are truly capable of bringing any wonder you wish to life. Your personal life is shifting for the better and this is because you first chose to make peace with it, then looked for ways to improve it.\n\nCosmic tip: Prioritise your health and wellbeing.\n\nThe page also lists headings for other zodiac signs (Aries, Taurus, Cancer, Leo, Libra, Scorpio, Virgo, Sagittarius, Capricorn, Aquarius, Pisces) for the same date, indicating a complete daily horoscope section for readers to explore.\n\nAuthor: Snehaa Khanna Sahgal. Publisher: Cond\u00e9 Nast India.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Cond\u00e9 Nast. All rights reserved. Use of the website constitutes acceptance of the site's terms, privacy and cookie policies. The material may not be reproduced, distributed or used without prior written permission.",
